{"3534190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YOKAI WAIFU HUNTERS", "steam_appid": 3534190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/159f6331a420a5b0990b1d35b06ff1ca.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/159f6331a420a5b0990b1d35b06ff1ca.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/159f6331a420a5b0990b1d35b06ff1ca.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yokai Hunt in Feudal Japan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark world of feudal Japan, where ancient evil lurks in the shadows. Join a team of yokai hunters as you explore cursed villages, abandoned temples, sinister catacombs, and forgotten fortresses to banish the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/37d926e7d4bd3023ce5d2f46659f1d91.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/37d926e7d4bd3023ce5d2f46659f1d91.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/37d926e7d4bd3023ce5d2f46659f1d91.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Horror Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a team and choose your class — each hunter possesses unique abilities vital for survival. Strategy and teamwork are key to victory. In these cursed lands, no one survives alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/5155a6e86ee0da6538251188483ab8fd.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/5155a6e86ee0da6538251188483ab8fd.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/5155a6e86ee0da6538251188483ab8fd.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class System with Unique Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role: samurai, kunoichi, monk, or priestess. Each class comes with distinct powers. Work together with your team to make the most of your strengths and overcome the horrors dwelling in these haunted lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/75774bc0de4481a46ca084797f0779ab.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/75774bc0de4481a46ca084797f0779ab.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/75774bc0de4481a46ca084797f0779ab.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Rituals and Magic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat the yokai, brute strength won’t be enough. Collect sacred artifacts, perform dangerous rituals, and harness magical powers to drive out the evil. Every action could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/0d5208d8f654e6f4651639305788116e.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/0d5208d8f654e6f4651639305788116e.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/0d5208d8f654e6f4651639305788116e.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battles with Unique Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every yokai is more than just a monster—they are distinct threats with their own behaviors and weaknesses. Study their patterns and find their vulnerabilities, or you won’t live to tell the tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/ca0debb32abec1923052f8b1eafad9e8.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/ca0debb32abec1923052f8b1eafad9e8.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/ca0debb32abec1923052f8b1eafad9e8.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability and Changing Locations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough tells a new story. Locations are procedurally generated, and enemies and artifacts change every time. The darker it gets, the more dangerous it becomes. Work together, gather sacred relics, fulfill your objectives, and escape while you still can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/52955ce667a0f54ac446ce924c686c27.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/52955ce667a0f54ac446ce924c686c27.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/52955ce667a0f54ac446ce924c686c27.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Atmosphere and Grim Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie, abandoned locations filled with secrets and dangers, where every step brings you closer to uncovering the ancient evil. Many have tried to stop the darkness — few have returned.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/159f6331a420a5b0990b1d35b06ff1ca.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/159f6331a420a5b0990b1d35b06ff1ca.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/159f6331a420a5b0990b1d35b06ff1ca.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yokai Hunt in Feudal Japan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dark world of feudal Japan, where ancient evil lurks in the shadows. Join a team of yokai hunters as you explore cursed villages, abandoned temples, sinister catacombs, and forgotten fortresses to banish the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/37d926e7d4bd3023ce5d2f46659f1d91.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/37d926e7d4bd3023ce5d2f46659f1d91.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/37d926e7d4bd3023ce5d2f46659f1d91.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Horror Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a team and choose your class — each hunter possesses unique abilities vital for survival. Strategy and teamwork are key to victory. In these cursed lands, no one survives alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/5155a6e86ee0da6538251188483ab8fd.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/5155a6e86ee0da6538251188483ab8fd.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/5155a6e86ee0da6538251188483ab8fd.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class System with Unique Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role: samurai, kunoichi, monk, or priestess. Each class comes with distinct powers. Work together with your team to make the most of your strengths and overcome the horrors dwelling in these haunted lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/75774bc0de4481a46ca084797f0779ab.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/75774bc0de4481a46ca084797f0779ab.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/75774bc0de4481a46ca084797f0779ab.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Rituals and Magic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat the yokai, brute strength won’t be enough. Collect sacred artifacts, perform dangerous rituals, and harness magical powers to drive out the evil. Every action could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/0d5208d8f654e6f4651639305788116e.poster.avif?t=1781024572\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/0d5208d8f654e6f4651639305788116e.webm?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534190/extras/0d5208d8f654e6f4651639305788116e.mp4?t=1781024572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Battles with Unique Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every yokai is more than just a monster—they are distinct threats with their own behaviors and weaknesses. Study their patterns and find their vulnerabilities, or you won’t live to tell the tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a